      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.86 (vs ₹4.92 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.86 (down from ₹4.92 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹1.16b (up 6.3% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹2.64m (down 82% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 0.2% (down from 1.4% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 23% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 3% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
